#: config-gui/hotcorners_config.py:1707
msgid "Enable tap/linger and contexts?"
msgstr ""

#: config-gui/hotcorners_config.py:1709
msgid ""
"This upgrades your configuration so that each hot zone can have a separate "
"tap action and linger action, and so that bindings can differ per activity "
"and per virtual desktop.\n"
"\n"
"What is kept: every action you have configured, and every cooldown value, "
"exactly as they are. They become the \"Default\" context, which applies "
"whenever no more specific context matches.\n"
"\n"
"What changes: the configuration is stored in a newer format. Nothing is "
"written until you choose Apply, and older versions of this tool will not "
"read the new format.\n"
"\n"
"Continue?"
msgstr ""

